<title>USA: Vimpel stake held by FMR group.</title>
<headline>Vimpel stake held by FMR group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said Tuesday it holds a 5.8 percent stake in Vimpel-Communications (Open Joint Stock Co), or 304,160 American Depositary Shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include a net 72,800 ADRs bought between December 12 and January 8 at prices ranging from $23.75 to $26.375 per ADR.</p>
<p>The group said it acquired the stake for investment purposes.</p>
<p>The Moscow-based mobile telephone firm first begain trading on November 14, 1996, as the first Russian company to trade on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
